 that would make it possible, so I guess the visual appearance is intended.\r\n\r\n*Spheres at the top are smooth, while spheres at the bottom are rough. Spheres at the right are dielectric, while spheres at the left are metallic.*\r\n\r\n### With DirectionalLight3D\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31aac26f-b3f6-4b73-ac74-7b4e296c5e5b) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a102ebc-e4e9-4981-8c56-d469b8588d35)\r\n\r\n### Without DirectionalLight3D\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c325500d-cc88-452b-b02c-0474cd8ffbcd) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/604a7a0c-e974-4043-a8f4-09f5042b906e)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103934#pullrequestreview-2672257869","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103934","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-10T21:33:38Z"},{"id":2772817245,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6lRdVd","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"What is the issue with implementing multiscattering? \r\n\r\nWe discussed this in the rendering meeting this week and agreed that we should just go straight for the multiscattering LUT unless there is a technical reason not to","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103934#pullrequestreview-2772817245","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103934","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_